  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Photogrammetry</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> March 2022 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Over the course of several years, I have used photogrammetry to scan various structures. The project functions as a spatial collage of places and beings across time.</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--f